## Core Features

- **Tool Library System** (tool-library.mjs)
  - ToolLibrary class for managing multiple tools/materials
  - Default presets for 3D printing (PLA, PETG, TPU) and CNC milling
  - JSON import/export for tool configurations
  - Per-tool properties: name, type, diameter, color, Z offset, speed/temp

- **G-Code Parser Extensions** (parser.mjs)
  - Parse T commands (tool selection: T0, T1, T2)
  - Parse M6 (tool change)
  - Parse G43/H (tool length offset enable)
  - Parse G49 (cancel tool offset)

- **Enhanced Toolpath Generation** (toolpath.mjs)
  - Track active tool per movement
  - Apply tool length offsets (G43)
  - Add tool-change markers
  - Include toolConfig in each point

- **Multi-Tool Visualization** (toolpath-renderer.mjs)
  - Color-coded toolpath by active tool
  - Separate rendering for rapid/cut moves
  - Tool change markers (spheres)
  - Calculate statistics (distances per tool, tool changes)

## UI Enhancements (front.html)

- New Tool Library panel with:
  - Tool selector dropdown
