## Examples

- multifilament-demo.gcode - Two-color 3D printing
- multitool-cnc-demo.gcode - Three-tool CNC milling

## API Changes

### Breaking Changes:
- parseGCodeToPoints() now accepts options.toolLibrary parameter
- Point types changed: 'G0' → 'rapid', 'G1' → 'cut'
- Points now include: tool (index), toolConfig (object)
- Points include new type: 'tool-change' for M6 commands
- Default tool is 0 (was null)

### Backward Compatibility:
- Parser still works without tool commands
- Toolpath generation works without toolLibrary
- Existing G-Code without tool commands renders normally

