- ⚠️ **Early detection** - Identifies programming errors instantly
- 📋 **Validation** - Ensures feed rates and speeds are safe
- 💰 **Cost savings** - Avoids expensive crashes and repairs
- 🎯 **Confidence** - Know your G-Code is safe before running

