## ✅ Phase 9.2 Complete: User Authentication UI

**Complete authentication system with API and UI:**

### 🔐 Authentication API (240 lines)
**Endpoints:**
- `POST /api/auth/register` — User registration with validation
- `POST /api/auth/login` — Login with JWT token generation
- `GET /api/auth/me` — Get current user profile
- `PUT /api/auth/profile` — Update email and display name
- `PUT /api/auth/password` — Change password securely
- `POST /api/auth/logout` — Logout (client-side token removal)

