- Input validation (username 3-50 chars, password 8+ chars)
- Duplicate username/email checks
- bcrypt password hashing
- JWT token generation with role/userId claims
- Metrics tracking for all operations
- Proper error handling and HTTP status codes

### 💻 Client-Side Auth UI (460 lines)
**AuthUI Class:**
- Registration modal with password confirmation
- Login modal
- Profile management modal
- Password change modal
- Token persistence (localStorage)
- Automatic token verification on page load
- Event-driven auth state changes
- API call helper with automatic auth headers

**Integration:**
```javascript
const auth = new AuthUI();
auth.init();
auth.onAuthChange = (user) => {
  console.log(user ? `Logged in as ${user.username}` : 'Logged out');
};
```

### 🎨 Professional UI (230 lines CSS)
- Clean modal design
- Responsive layout
- Form validation styling
- Error message display
- Smooth transitions
- Auth status bar (top-right)
- Mobile-friendly

### 📦 Server Integration
- Auth routes integrated into production server
- Database initialization on startup
- Conditional database support (graceful degradation)
- Database health check (1-minute intervals)

